<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="2c4198b3">&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Review and refine approach with key stakeholders
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Update approach to reflect feedback (if required)
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Agree on the review process for end user material to include the following activities: 
        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Define responsibilities and timings for reviewing end user material (including internal peer review
                process)
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Populate template with review and sign-off responsibilities and timings
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Ensure those expected to sign off are aware of their responsibilities and likely timings for receipt of
                documents for review
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Ensure that any change in timings and final milestones are incorporated into an overarching plan
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
